%% Container-level sequence: SD-03 What-if prediction (UC-05; FR-07, FR-08, FR-11)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor BM as Building Manager
  participant WEB as Web Dashboard<br/>(src/frontend)
  participant API as Backend API<br/>(api/predictions.py)
  participant MS as Model Artifact Store<br/>(models/)
  participant DB as Energy Database<br/>(SQLite)

  Note over API,MS: At startup the API loads energy_model.joblib once (cached)
  API->>MS: load model + metadata
  MS-->>API: model, feature list, version

  BM->>WEB: fill what-if form (time, temperatures, humidity, weather, lights)
  WEB->>API: POST /api/predict {features}
  API->>API: validate with Pydantic schema (types, ranges)
  alt invalid input
    API-->>WEB: 422 {field errors}
    WEB-->>BM: highlight invalid fields
  else model not loaded
    API-->>WEB: 503 {detail: "model unavailable"}
  else valid
    API->>API: build feature vector, model.predict()
    API->>DB: INSERT predictions (source=whatif, input, predicted_wh, model_run_id)
    DB-->>API: prediction id
    API-->>WEB: 200 {predicted_wh, unit:"Wh", model_version}
    WEB-->>BM: show predicted energy next to typical value for that hour
  end
